WEBVTT

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:02.350
Well, let's get crackin'.

00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:03.580
Let's-a-go.

00:00:04.030 --> 00:00:05.920
Stop messing around and start!

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:33.290
Yutaka!

00:01:33.290 --> 00:01:34.670
It's almost time to go!

00:01:46.380 --> 00:01:48.100
Oof.

00:01:49.930 --> 00:01:51.690
Okay, little sister of mine.

00:01:51.690 --> 00:01:53.310
Today's the beginning of your new life!

00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:54.910
Let's go with a bang!

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:09.040
I'm here to report that Yutaka's passed and say hi!

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:11.460
Welcome.

00:02:11.690 --> 00:02:13.260
Come on, Yutaka.

00:02:14.450 --> 00:02:18.710
I-I'll probably be causing lots of trouble...

00:02:18.710 --> 00:02:20.970
...but I hope we can get along well!

00:02:20.970 --> 00:02:24.380
Just think of this as your own home.

00:02:24.380 --> 00:02:25.220
Yes.

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:27.180
Let me start by congratulating you on passing.

00:02:27.180 --> 00:02:28.060
Thank you!

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:29.770
It's a good thing she passed.

00:02:30.010 --> 00:02:31.300
Now you can meet that handkerchief girl.

00:02:31.300 --> 00:02:34.060
<i>I win at life.</i>

00:02:46.190 --> 00:02:47.120
Um...

00:02:47.120 --> 00:02:48.580
Are you all right?

00:02:50.820 --> 00:02:53.160
Do you want me to take you to the nurse's office?

00:02:53.360 --> 00:02:55.250
So she talked to me...

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:57.710
...and even lent me her handkerchief!

00:02:57.710 --> 00:03:00.630
I'm so happy that I might
be able to make a good friend.

00:03:00.900 --> 00:03:01.960
But Yutaka...

00:03:01.960 --> 00:03:03.970
She might've failed.

00:03:04.580 --> 00:03:06.050
That won't happen!

00:03:06.050 --> 00:03:08.350
People like her definitely pass!

00:03:08.350 --> 00:03:09.810
I know how you feel...

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:12.020
She's definitely smart!

00:03:12.020 --> 00:03:14.520
Thank you for the baseless rebuttal.

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:15.650
But you know...

00:03:15.650 --> 00:03:16.480
...Yu-chan.

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:19.200
What if you fail?

00:03:19.890 --> 00:03:22.740
That's actually possible...

00:03:24.850 --> 00:03:27.650
Well, you should be fine.

00:03:27.650 --> 00:03:28.570
That's right.

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:32.040
I should be able to meet her on the
day they announce results regardless.

00:03:32.240 --> 00:03:33.330
I see.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:35.750
I have to return the handkerchief.

00:03:40.500 --> 00:03:42.050
E-Excuse me!

00:03:44.170 --> 00:03:45.220
Here.

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:47.300
I'm glad I ran into you.

00:03:47.300 --> 00:03:49.850
I've been wanting to return this.

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:53.850
You came to deliver this?

00:03:53.850 --> 00:03:54.310
Yes.

00:03:55.310 --> 00:03:57.650
I guess I ended troubling you.

00:03:57.650 --> 00:04:00.190
I didn't expect to ever see you again.

00:04:00.190 --> 00:04:02.940
I never intended to have this returned.

00:04:04.140 --> 00:04:06.970
I was worried I might fail.

00:04:06.970 --> 00:04:08.040
Oh.

00:04:08.860 --> 00:04:09.490
I see.

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:12.450
If you're here now...

00:04:12.450 --> 00:04:14.120
...you're in the same year.

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.380
I'm sorry.

00:04:16.030 --> 00:04:18.710
You probably thought I was someone's little sister.

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:21.540
I came by car today.

00:04:21.540 --> 00:04:22.460
O-Okay.

00:04:22.660 --> 00:04:24.390
Then we'll be parting here.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:27.380
Um...

00:04:27.690 --> 00:04:30.390
I hope we can have a great three years!

00:04:37.340 --> 00:04:38.600
<i>What a relief.</i>

00:04:38.600 --> 00:04:41.990
<i>I already became friends with
such a nice person in high school.</i>

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:45.570
<i>I didn't ask what her name was.</i>

00:04:46.220 --> 00:04:48.700
Make sure you ask for her name next time.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:53.170
Are you feeling sick, Yu-chan?

00:04:54.280 --> 00:04:56.910
I think I got a little carsick.

00:04:56.910 --> 00:04:58.370
I took some medicine though...

00:04:58.600 --> 00:05:00.710
Sorry to worry you.

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:03.710
Yutaka's got such a weak body.

00:05:03.870 --> 00:05:04.380
<i>Wait.</i>

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:05.380
<i>That's part of it...</i>

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:08.670
<i>...but you need to realize
what your driving's like, Cousin Yui.</i>

00:05:08.670 --> 00:05:11.390
<i>Even I get a little blargh...</i>

00:05:11.390 --> 00:05:15.390
But I'm the only one from my
old school who's going to Ryouou...

00:05:15.890 --> 00:05:18.680
And I'll probably get sick again like today...

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:20.890
I'm worried about if I can
get along with my classmates.

00:05:20.890 --> 00:05:24.240
You're a good girl so it'll be fine.

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:26.990
You're treating me like a child!

00:05:29.400 --> 00:05:31.160
Brain...

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:32.830
...converting...

00:05:33.610 --> 00:05:38.450
If Yu-chan got together with
our Miyuki-san, it'd be pretty crazy.

00:05:47.910 --> 00:05:49.010
That's right.

00:05:49.010 --> 00:05:51.680
I'm in Big Sister Konata's house now.

00:05:57.010 --> 00:05:57.970
Big Sister.

00:05:57.970 --> 00:05:58.890
Good morning!

00:05:58.890 --> 00:06:00.600
You're up awfully early when we don't have school.

00:06:00.600 --> 00:06:01.520
Morning.

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:04.690
Actually, I'm about to hit the sack.

00:06:04.690 --> 00:06:06.870
I was gaming all nigh—

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:10.320
<i>This really is a different environment!</i>

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:13.860
We have to take exams next year, huh?

00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:17.960
We've been getting a bunch
of phone calls from cram schools.

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:21.290
If you use caller ID...

00:06:21.290 --> 00:06:24.420
...you should be able to pick
out those kinds of calls immediately.

00:06:24.420 --> 00:06:27.040
Since they use unlisted numbers.

00:06:27.250 --> 00:06:28.710
I'm home!

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:32.760
Caller ID, huh...

00:06:33.220 --> 00:06:34.970
I've come home!

00:06:34.970 --> 00:06:36.100
My...

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:37.810
Is that so?

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:40.470
That must have been difficult.

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:41.230
Not at all...

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:43.530
It's the same for our family.

00:06:44.260 --> 00:06:47.400
Well, my daughter's returned...

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.320
Yes.

00:06:48.320 --> 00:06:49.980
Until we talk again then.

00:06:49.980 --> 00:06:51.490
Sorry to have taken up your time.

00:06:51.730 --> 00:06:53.400
Who was on the phone?

00:06:53.400 --> 00:06:55.620
It sounded like you were having a lively conversation.

00:06:55.620 --> 00:06:57.700
It was from a telemarketer.

00:06:57.700 --> 00:06:58.490
Um...

00:06:58.490 --> 00:07:02.210
Didn't you say that you could
pick out those calls immediately?

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:03.540
But you know...

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:06.290
I was bored and felt like having a conversation.

00:07:06.290 --> 00:07:08.420
We talked over an hour.

00:07:08.810 --> 00:07:10.380
This should be your total.

00:07:10.380 --> 00:07:11.090
Whyistherealreadyanewitem?!

00:07:11.340 --> 00:07:13.300
What's wrong, Kona-chan?

00:07:13.300 --> 00:07:14.090
Tsukasa!

00:07:14.090 --> 00:07:15.890
This world is always a battlefield!

00:07:15.890 --> 00:07:17.350
You can never show mercy!

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:19.900
The other day, there was a little item I wanted...

00:07:19.900 --> 00:07:20.470
Should I exchange my points...

00:07:20.470 --> 00:07:20.560
I spent half a day thinking about it...

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:20.900
...Nah... but
I spent half a day thinking about it...
Should I exchange my points...

00:07:20.900 --> 00:07:21.840
there's other stuff I want...

00:07:21.840 --> 00:07:22.080
I spent half a day thinking about it...
Should I exchange my points...

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:22.600
Okay!

00:07:22.600 --> 00:07:22.680
...and ended up deciding to exchange my points...

00:07:22.680 --> 00:07:24.350
I'll go on the offensive!
...and ended up deciding to exchange my points...

00:07:24.590 --> 00:07:28.440
But now there's already a new item I really want!

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:29.480
Look! Over there!

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:31.320
I don't have enough points left!

00:07:31.320 --> 00:07:33.400
What to do?!

00:07:33.400 --> 00:07:35.910
You sure enjoy your life.

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:36.610
Uh...

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:37.620
You haven't paid...

00:07:37.890 --> 00:07:41.080
Would you prefer smoking or non-smoking?

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:42.080
Well...

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:43.910
We're minors...

00:07:43.910 --> 00:07:45.920
...so a non-smoking table please.

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:47.880
Then please follow me.

00:07:47.880 --> 00:07:50.140
I'm going to the restroom first.

00:07:52.750 --> 00:07:54.170
Hey, Tsukasa!

00:07:54.170 --> 00:07:55.630
Over here!

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:57.780
Welcome back.

00:07:57.780 --> 00:07:59.310
I'm back.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:01.310
Hey...

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:02.850
I've been wondering...

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:04.980
Why are the restrooms in these places...

00:08:04.980 --> 00:08:08.350
...usually located near the smoking section?

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:09.400
That's true.

00:08:09.400 --> 00:08:12.120
Especially when we're in the non-smoking section.

00:08:13.060 --> 00:08:14.110
But really...

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:15.110
I wonder why...

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:19.950
So there's a nearby water source if a fire starts.

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:22.470
They have buckets and hoses, too.

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:23.990
They even have hoses.

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:25.120
They do!

00:08:25.120 --> 00:08:26.960
They sure do!

00:08:28.160 --> 00:08:31.710
Typical of a person who's never
worked out in the real world.

00:08:31.710 --> 00:08:32.670
What a pain.

00:08:32.670 --> 00:08:32.870
Good grief.

00:08:32.870 --> 00:08:33.880
You're annoying!
Good grief.

00:08:33.880 --> 00:08:35.970
Or maybe to cover up the stink.

00:08:35.970 --> 00:08:36.880
And like...

00:08:36.880 --> 00:08:39.010
Don't talk about this stuff while we're eating.

00:08:39.010 --> 00:08:40.340
Stuff like the stink or restrooms...

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:41.720
Currently, in the city...

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:43.930
...a number of elementary school girls...

00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:47.850
...have been approached from
behind while on their way to school...

00:08:47.850 --> 00:08:51.360
There are a lot more cases of kids being targeted.

00:08:51.630 --> 00:08:53.940
You should be careful, Yu-chan.

00:08:53.940 --> 00:08:54.860
That's right.

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:55.740
You have to!

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:58.820
Well, I can understand the
perpetrator's way of thinking...

00:08:58.820 --> 00:08:59.740
Really...

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:03.450
He's been all over the news for consecutive days now...

00:09:03.450 --> 00:09:06.200
...yet he's still going up to little kids?!

00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:07.460
What does he want?!

00:09:07.460 --> 00:09:08.710
I really want to tell him something!

00:09:08.960 --> 00:09:10.540
Man, I'm jealous.

00:09:10.540 --> 00:09:12.790
I have no idea what you're thinking...

00:09:12.790 --> 00:09:16.430
...but don't do anything
that'll get you arrested by Cousin Yui.

00:09:20.570 --> 00:09:22.390
Excuse me!

00:09:22.390 --> 00:09:23.140
Coming!

00:09:23.490 --> 00:09:24.370
Hey!

00:09:24.370 --> 00:09:25.010
I'm here!

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:26.060
Welcome!

00:09:38.810 --> 00:09:40.860
Oh, where's Kagami today?

00:09:40.860 --> 00:09:43.780
She went out with some friends from her class.

00:09:45.420 --> 00:09:46.590
I see.

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:50.750
I'm kinda annoyed and then
it feels like something's missing...

00:09:50.750 --> 00:09:52.500
I guess you're lonely.

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:01.510
It's gotten really warm lately.

00:10:01.510 --> 00:10:03.230
Sure has.

00:10:05.760 --> 00:10:08.140
We don't have any homework for spring break...

00:10:08.140 --> 00:10:09.480
...so it's really tranquil.

00:10:09.480 --> 00:10:10.350
Sure is.

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:11.590
Pretty sure that...

00:10:11.590 --> 00:10:16.200
...only people who normally
work hard have the right to say that.

00:10:18.810 --> 00:10:21.080
Don't hit any place weird!

00:10:22.100 --> 00:10:23.250
No more!

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:26.330
Say...

00:10:26.330 --> 00:10:29.840
Do you even recognize the
characters in these robot games?

00:10:29.840 --> 00:10:31.760
Some of them.

00:10:32.410 --> 00:10:33.280
I see...

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:35.210
Since your manga and anime preferences...

00:10:35.210 --> 00:10:37.340
...were influenced by your dad.

00:10:37.340 --> 00:10:38.130
Yep.

00:10:38.410 --> 00:10:39.340
In that case...

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:44.190
Didn't you have a hard time understanding what your female friends were talking about when you were little?

00:10:44.190 --> 00:10:44.890
Why?

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:48.940
I actually saw more of that kind of
stuff, so there wasn't any problem.

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:51.180
Really...

00:10:51.180 --> 00:10:51.640
Huh?

00:10:52.110 --> 00:10:53.600
Is that your final answer?

00:10:54.130 --> 00:10:55.610
Final answer!

00:11:10.400 --> 00:11:11.910
Why can't they just tell us?

00:11:11.910 --> 00:11:13.000
I couldn't even breathe.

00:11:13.000 --> 00:11:14.130
And his face is scary.

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:15.000
And huge.

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:19.040
<i>Looking at the clock, she must
have gotten the question wrong.</i>

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:20.870
<i>The show's already over.</i>

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:22.170
Wait, Tsukasa!

00:11:22.170 --> 00:11:26.980
Can you stop guessing if they got the question right based on the amount of time left when they cut to commercial?!

00:11:27.380 --> 00:11:30.140
But I can't take the waiting...

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:31.640
And they really drag it out...

00:11:31.850 --> 00:11:33.930
Isn't that the point of the show?!

00:11:33.930 --> 00:11:35.350
But it's what Tsukasa would do.

00:11:37.370 --> 00:11:38.460
Yo.

00:11:38.460 --> 00:11:39.610
Yahoo!

00:11:39.610 --> 00:11:40.860
Let me introduce you.

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:43.110
This is my cousin, Yu-chan.

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.150
N-Nice to meet you.

00:11:45.150 --> 00:11:46.860
I'm Yutaka Kobayakawa.

00:11:46.860 --> 00:11:49.870
These are my friends Tsukasa and Kagami.

00:11:49.870 --> 00:11:52.960
Then you're the ones
Big Sister's always talking about...

00:11:53.670 --> 00:11:55.330
What does she say about us?

00:11:57.670 --> 00:11:58.420
Hey.

00:11:58.420 --> 00:11:59.960
What did you tell her?

00:11:59.960 --> 00:12:01.550
Though I can guess from her reaction...

00:12:01.550 --> 00:12:02.130
See?

00:12:02.130 --> 00:12:03.670
Just like I told you.

00:12:03.670 --> 00:12:06.950
Did you already have your
graduation ceremony, Yutaka-chan?

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:07.510
Yes.

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:08.590
A few days ago.

00:12:08.590 --> 00:12:10.100
Graduation, huh?

00:12:10.100 --> 00:12:11.470
Brings back memories.

00:12:11.470 --> 00:12:14.560
I don't even remember our graduation.

00:12:14.560 --> 00:12:17.650
Did you get a second button
from anyone, Yutaka-chan?

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:19.270
No, I didn't.

00:12:19.710 --> 00:12:22.190
Our middle school uniform was a blazer.

00:12:22.190 --> 00:12:23.480
Oh, yeah...

00:12:23.480 --> 00:12:25.280
I guess a lot more schools are like that now.

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:26.280
Actually...

00:12:26.280 --> 00:12:31.160
...does the practice of getting
something from the person you like still exist?

00:12:31.160 --> 00:12:32.530
Really?

00:12:32.530 --> 00:12:34.450
That's kinda sad.

00:12:34.450 --> 00:12:36.040
Not that I ever did it.

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:38.170
If you read blogs...

00:12:38.170 --> 00:12:41.090
...it looks like quite a few people are still doing it.

00:12:41.540 --> 00:12:42.420
But you know...

00:12:42.420 --> 00:12:45.240
You take it from someone you like, right?

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:46.920
Well, in most cases.

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:47.550
Then...

00:12:47.550 --> 00:12:50.970
...wouldn't going to get a button be
the same as confessing how you feel?

00:12:50.970 --> 00:12:55.310
Wouldn't it be better to just confess
and get the guy instead of a button?

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:58.350
Ideally, sure.

00:12:58.710 --> 00:12:59.460
That's right.

00:12:59.460 --> 00:13:02.570
Did you like anyone at your old school?

00:13:02.570 --> 00:13:03.360
No.

00:13:03.520 --> 00:13:06.110
I was often absent from school...

00:13:06.110 --> 00:13:08.400
When I did go, I would soon get sick.

00:13:08.740 --> 00:13:11.600
I just made everyone feel bad.

00:13:11.600 --> 00:13:13.830
And I'm all small...

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:16.000
...and I look like a child...

00:13:16.000 --> 00:13:18.310
...so everyone always teased me.

00:13:18.310 --> 00:13:21.600
I never had time to like anybody...

00:13:22.040 --> 00:13:23.210
Don't worry!

00:13:23.210 --> 00:13:26.510
You'll have no problems if you aren't picky!

00:13:26.510 --> 00:13:27.850
Wh-What?!

00:13:27.850 --> 00:13:28.630
Pocky!

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:29.550
Yu-chan.

00:13:29.550 --> 00:13:31.440
Show me your graduation yearbook.

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:33.140
I wanna see it!

00:13:33.390 --> 00:13:35.680
This is kinda embarrassing.

00:13:35.680 --> 00:13:37.730
I don't show up very often.

00:13:43.680 --> 00:13:44.900
Yu-chan, what class were you in?

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:49.910
You checked the absentee section first, didn't you?!

00:13:50.230 --> 00:13:51.880
You could tell?

00:13:53.400 --> 00:13:56.290
The differences between
middle school and high school?

00:13:57.280 --> 00:14:00.120
The fact that joining a club is no longer mandatory.

00:14:00.120 --> 00:14:02.450
Doesn't that depend on the school?

00:14:02.450 --> 00:14:04.120
Our school's geared towards getting into college...

00:14:04.120 --> 00:14:07.800
...so there will probably be
more material at a faster pace.

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:10.220
And the commute takes a while...

00:14:10.220 --> 00:14:11.880
...so you'll need some stamina.

00:14:11.880 --> 00:14:13.680
The decisive difference is that...

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:18.170
...class time naps have grown longer from
grade school to middle school to high school.

00:14:18.170 --> 00:14:20.280
Especially during classes you're bad at!

00:14:20.280 --> 00:14:21.730
That's actually true!

00:14:21.730 --> 00:14:24.610
The teacher sounds like
he's talking in a foreign language...

00:14:24.610 --> 00:14:24.640
...and my mind just starts slipping away!

00:14:24.640 --> 00:14:27.700
Make sure you don't end up like them.
...and my mind just starts slipping away!

00:14:29.560 --> 00:14:32.110
You brought your middle school uniform.

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:34.850
Our uniform is pretty plain...

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:37.280
...so I thought I could wear it normally.

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:38.950
Since I'm no longer close to school.

00:14:38.950 --> 00:14:40.370
I see.

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:43.040
What did you guys do with your uniforms?

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:46.130
We gave ours to some younger neighbors.

00:14:46.130 --> 00:14:47.090
What about you?

00:14:47.090 --> 00:14:48.190
Mine?

00:14:48.190 --> 00:14:48.670
Well...

00:14:48.670 --> 00:14:50.760
You wouldn't be able to give yours to anyone.

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:51.920
Be quiet.

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:53.500
How rude.

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:56.850
I saved mine for cosplay use like Yu-chan.

00:14:56.850 --> 00:14:58.060
C-Cos..?

00:14:58.060 --> 00:14:59.680
When you put it that way...

00:14:59.680 --> 00:15:01.350
...it really gets on my nerves.

00:15:01.350 --> 00:15:02.770
But it's cosplay.

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:04.250
Anyway...

00:15:04.250 --> 00:15:05.560
Our old school, huh?

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:07.400
Now that you've brought it up...

00:15:07.910 --> 00:15:11.900
...I kind of want to go visit my
grade school and middle school.

00:15:12.070 --> 00:15:15.160
But there have been a bunch
of incidents involving trespassing...

00:15:15.160 --> 00:15:18.160
...so people might give you funny looks.

00:15:18.320 --> 00:15:20.410
Well, you don't have to worry.

00:15:20.410 --> 00:15:22.120
You'll fit in just fine.

00:15:22.120 --> 00:15:25.170
Pretty sure that wasn't a compliment.

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:28.320
But vacations sure pass by quickly.

00:15:28.320 --> 00:15:29.420
That's true.

00:15:29.420 --> 00:15:32.210
Before you know it, it's back to school.

00:15:32.210 --> 00:15:37.550
Spring is a pain with physical
exams and measurements.

00:15:37.550 --> 00:15:41.230
But you've got really athletic nerves. Lucky you.

00:15:42.380 --> 00:15:43.680
Hey, Tsukasa.

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:46.650
Which nerves are the athletic nerves?

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:49.770
Hello, everyone!

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:50.610
I'm a little late...

00:15:50.610 --> 00:15:52.650
...but congratulations on graduating, Yutaka!

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:53.570
Cousin Yui.

00:15:53.570 --> 00:15:54.320
Welcome.

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:56.240
To celebrate...

00:15:56.240 --> 00:15:58.200
...let's all go get smashed!

00:15:58.200 --> 00:15:59.370
Invite your dad, too.

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:00.490
My treat!

00:16:00.490 --> 00:16:01.700
Sis!

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:02.660
We can't do that!

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:03.200
Sis!

00:16:03.200 --> 00:16:03.910
<i>Officer, we're still minors.</i>

00:16:03.910 --> 00:16:06.460
W-We can't!

00:16:06.460 --> 00:16:07.780
Sis.

00:16:07.780 --> 00:16:11.550
I don't think we can go in those places yet.

00:16:12.960 --> 00:16:14.720
If you just stroll on in...

00:16:14.720 --> 00:16:16.130
...they'll never catch you!

00:16:16.130 --> 00:16:18.220
I did it all the time when I was a student!

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:20.050
They never caught me once!

00:16:20.590 --> 00:16:20.630
<i>No.</i>

00:16:20.630 --> 00:16:21.310
We can't!
<i>No.</i>

00:16:21.310 --> 00:16:21.640
<i>Your two relatives will get us caught.</i>
We can't!

00:16:21.640 --> 00:16:24.140
We can't, Sis!
<i>Your two relatives will get us caught.</i>

00:16:30.010 --> 00:16:31.360
I see...

00:16:32.230 --> 00:16:33.950
Don't mind.

00:16:35.850 --> 00:16:37.650
Since Yu-chan's here...

00:16:37.650 --> 00:16:39.070
...we could go to Disneyland or something.

00:16:39.300 --> 00:16:40.710
Since it's spring break.

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:42.370
Um...

00:16:42.370 --> 00:16:44.160
I really appreciate it...

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:47.040
...but I'm already imposing...

00:16:47.040 --> 00:16:49.670
...so you don't have to go so far.

00:16:49.670 --> 00:16:53.850
And I already went there on
a school field trip a while back.

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:57.670
Yeah, I had a field trip like that, too.

00:16:57.670 --> 00:17:00.260
But were you okay?

00:17:00.260 --> 00:17:01.720
I didn't get sick.

00:17:01.720 --> 00:17:03.060
It was fun!

00:17:03.060 --> 00:17:04.470
And I was with my friends.

00:17:04.650 --> 00:17:05.140
No...

00:17:05.140 --> 00:17:08.270
I was talking about the minimum height for rides.

00:17:08.270 --> 00:17:10.270
It was okay!

00:17:10.270 --> 00:17:12.110
I'm in high school now!

00:17:14.440 --> 00:17:18.110
So I was watching this school drama...

00:17:18.110 --> 00:17:21.990
...when I realized there are a lot of
differences between middle school and high school.

00:17:21.990 --> 00:17:23.120
Guess so.

00:17:23.120 --> 00:17:26.830
They stop feeding you in high school.

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:28.000
That's right.

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:30.750
You make your own lunch or eat in the cafeteria.

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:32.040
Or buy a lunch to bring.

00:17:32.270 --> 00:17:35.640
Do you make a box lunch every day?!

00:17:36.660 --> 00:17:38.470
P-Pretty much.

00:17:39.420 --> 00:17:41.220
That's amazing!

00:17:41.220 --> 00:17:43.140
<i>This could get ugly...</i>

00:17:44.640 --> 00:17:46.220
You're really good at games!

00:17:47.220 --> 00:17:49.480
Skilled at many forms of communication!

00:17:50.560 --> 00:17:52.560
You can even cook and do other housework!

00:17:52.790 --> 00:17:56.820
I've recently learned how much
pressure an older sister feels.

00:17:56.820 --> 00:18:00.030
You have to work hard with those eyes on you, right...

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:01.200
...Kagami?

00:18:03.690 --> 00:18:06.030
<i>Cousin Yui, wild at the wheel.</i>

00:18:07.490 --> 00:18:08.500
Hey!

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:09.780
Doing good?

00:18:09.780 --> 00:18:12.210
<i>Cousin Yui, comes home drunk.</i>

00:18:12.410 --> 00:18:13.630
Homework?

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:16.960
Just put down something random.

00:18:16.960 --> 00:18:19.090
<i>Cousin Yui, never serious about anything.</i>

00:18:19.090 --> 00:18:21.970
But I guess it depends on the person.

00:18:21.970 --> 00:18:24.010
Make it so I can understand you.

00:18:27.340 --> 00:18:28.680
Final answer!

00:18:30.090 --> 00:18:33.230
Man, I seriously can't take this.

00:18:33.230 --> 00:18:36.320
I finally get to record a line for the actual show...

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:37.020
...but I wasn't even on screen!

00:18:37.020 --> 00:18:38.280
Doing it again today

00:18:38.280 --> 00:18:39.320
What are they thinking when they make this show?

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:40.570
Again.

00:18:40.570 --> 00:18:42.150
Why am I stuck with this lame
crap anybody could come up with...

00:18:42.150 --> 00:18:43.030
Akira-sama!

00:18:43.030 --> 00:18:43.950
The title call.

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:45.750
Title call!

00:18:45.750 --> 00:18:45.830
Why am I stuck with this lame
crap anybody could come up with...

00:18:46.230 --> 00:18:47.200
U-U-Uh...

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:48.700
The title call...

00:18:49.070 --> 00:18:50.170
Tiny eyes!

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:53.590
Good lucky...

00:18:54.160 --> 00:18:56.750
This isn't the time for that.

00:18:56.750 --> 00:18:58.460
Unbelievable. Incredible.

00:18:58.670 --> 00:19:00.420
Only my voice. My voice.

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:02.970
My appearance was pointless.

00:19:03.130 --> 00:19:04.470
U-Uh...

00:19:04.470 --> 00:19:05.890
I wasn't on screen either.

00:19:05.890 --> 00:19:08.600
Nobody gives a damn about you!

00:19:08.620 --> 00:19:10.070
Windy, huh?

00:19:10.630 --> 00:19:11.640
Hey...

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:13.560
Did I ask about you?

00:19:13.560 --> 00:19:14.140
Hey.

00:19:14.140 --> 00:19:17.560
Did I ever mention you?

00:19:18.270 --> 00:19:19.270
N-No...

00:19:19.270 --> 00:19:20.980
You didn't say a word about me.

00:19:20.980 --> 00:19:23.900
So why did you bring yourself up?

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:25.410
Don't be so self-centered.

00:19:25.410 --> 00:19:26.490
Are you an idiot?

00:19:26.490 --> 00:19:29.160
You're always like me, me, me.

00:19:29.160 --> 00:19:30.990
That's called being overly self-conscious.

00:19:31.160 --> 00:19:33.830
Make yourself scarce, Shiraishi.

00:19:33.830 --> 00:19:35.120
Sheesh, I'm gonna end up with a dirty mouth.

00:19:35.610 --> 00:19:36.210
Listen up.

00:19:36.210 --> 00:19:40.290
The issue here is the fact that Akira
Kogami wasn't shown in the actual show.

00:19:40.290 --> 00:19:40.710
Sure is.

00:19:40.710 --> 00:19:42.380
Let me ask you. What am I?

00:19:42.380 --> 00:19:43.720
An idol, right?

00:19:43.720 --> 00:19:45.930
An idol depends on her looks, right?

00:19:45.930 --> 00:19:47.930
Isn't it a given that I should be on screen?

00:19:47.930 --> 00:19:48.850
What do you think?

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:49.760
Y-Yes!

00:19:49.760 --> 00:19:51.110
You're absolutely right, sah!

00:19:52.670 --> 00:19:53.810
I can't hear you.

00:19:53.970 --> 00:19:56.270
T-The staff for this episode...

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:57.850
...acted in a logic-defying manner, sah!

00:20:01.640 --> 00:20:03.740
What are you writing?

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:14.290
So send in loads of encouragement!

00:20:14.290 --> 00:20:14.610
Loads...

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:16.160
Any method works!

00:20:16.160 --> 00:20:18.080
Just give them a push!

00:20:18.080 --> 00:20:22.130
Say that you're dying to see
me appear in the actual show!

00:20:22.130 --> 00:20:22.700
Dying...

00:20:22.700 --> 00:20:24.050
Just between you and me.

00:20:24.050 --> 00:20:25.420
The other members of the cast...

00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:27.470
...can't hold a candle...

00:20:27.470 --> 00:20:29.960
...to a performance that features
Akira's amazing talent and charm!

00:20:29.960 --> 00:20:31.390
She's desperate..

00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:33.480
She's really desperate today...

00:20:33.480 --> 00:20:33.680
...to a performance that features
Akira's amazing talent and charm!

00:20:34.090 --> 00:20:38.770
You can't wait to see such a
pretty and gorgeous performance!

00:20:38.770 --> 00:20:40.020
This is your chance!

00:20:40.020 --> 00:20:41.270
Don't let it slip away!

00:20:41.270 --> 00:20:42.820
Your feedback...

00:20:42.820 --> 00:20:44.520
...can make this a reality!

00:20:44.520 --> 00:20:45.870
What is it?

00:20:45.870 --> 00:20:47.110
...can make this a reality!

00:20:47.110 --> 00:20:47.770
So the second this show ends, start getting to work...

00:20:47.770 --> 00:20:48.440
Stop her?

00:20:48.440 --> 00:20:49.280
Understood.

00:20:49.280 --> 00:20:51.030
Um, Akira-sama...

00:20:51.030 --> 00:20:51.950
Shut up!

00:20:51.950 --> 00:20:53.870
Stop butting in!

00:20:53.870 --> 00:20:55.250
I was on a roll!

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:58.210
How many times do I have to
tell you not to get in my way?!

00:20:58.960 --> 00:21:00.630
What? Already?

00:21:00.950 --> 00:21:04.000
I wanted to tell you more
about how wonderful Akira is.

00:21:04.000 --> 00:21:08.510
You can see a lot more of my true
charm during next week's actual show.

00:21:08.510 --> 00:21:10.180
Just kidding.

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:10.930
Uh...

00:21:10.930 --> 00:21:12.510
Look forward to next time!

00:21:12.700 --> 00:21:14.060
Bye-bee!

00:21:16.260 --> 00:21:17.310
It's over.

00:21:17.310 --> 00:21:18.100
I'm in pain.

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:18.870
Hey, you.

00:21:18.870 --> 00:21:20.340
Go get the producer!

00:21:20.340 --> 00:21:21.310
Me?!

00:21:21.310 --> 00:21:21.940
First of all...

00:21:21.940 --> 00:21:22.210
Yes.

00:21:22.210 --> 00:21:24.860
This week's modified manuscript was wrong.

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:26.530
What's the name of this program?!

00:21:26.530 --> 00:21:27.740
Uh, Lucky Channel?

00:21:27.740 --> 00:21:29.740
It said Lucky Paradise.

00:21:29.740 --> 00:21:29.860
Also...

00:21:29.860 --> 00:21:30.490
Well...

00:21:30.490 --> 00:21:30.690
What is it?

00:21:30.690 --> 00:21:33.410
You've got guts to treat me like this!

00:21:33.410 --> 00:21:35.080
Just because your last show was a hit!

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:36.040
Hey, producers!

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:36.140
Don't mess with me!

00:21:36.140 --> 00:21:38.160
Wait, you really shouldn't be saying that!

00:21:38.160 --> 00:21:38.630
Hey!

00:21:40.470 --> 00:21:42.820
Miyagi-san!

00:21:43.470 --> 00:21:45.090
Hello, I'm Shiraishi!

00:21:45.090 --> 00:21:46.890
Okay! Please listen to me!

00:23:10.890 --> 00:23:13.580
Well, next time on Lucky Star:

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:14.910
I'm Minami Iwasaki.

00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:16.490
I'm Yutaka Kobayakawa.

00:23:16.490 --> 00:23:17.330
Iwasaki-san.

00:23:17.330 --> 00:23:20.750
The two of us are supposed
to introduce the next episode.

00:23:20.750 --> 00:23:22.420
Do you know what it's about?

00:23:22.420 --> 00:23:23.380
I don't.

00:23:23.950 --> 00:23:25.170
Sorry.

00:23:25.170 --> 00:23:26.320
Really?

00:23:26.320 --> 00:23:26.880
That's not good.

00:23:27.130 --> 00:23:29.310
I don't know either.

00:23:29.310 --> 00:23:31.140
Then we'll stop here.

00:23:31.590 --> 00:23:32.310
Next time:

00:23:32.310 --> 00:23:34.410
Can't Change So Quickly.

00:23:34.410 --> 00:23:37.060
Is it okay that we didn't say anything?

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:38.400
Look forward to next time.
